      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到这话的瞬间，多旺达的眼神动摇了一下。\n但这场试胆大会必须进入那洞窟取回符纸才能算完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6e917dee6ac504096e2d0899dff317e9e3bbe06ee457cd86387293794c6380c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
