      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "洞窟比森林还黑，狭窄得难以奔跑。\n虽然一直尊重她的意愿，鼓励她前行——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b219bb2a58ccc470762dcfc5961b9a847d315e7811b1f5a2230bd098607ee2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
