      "source_text": "但前方更为黑暗，脚下也更加不稳。\n请为您宝贵的安危，让我来为您引路吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa1cb58706ec1dcc45a4cfe3f400a00f4899c0408f3943abda0613c701c13f2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
